    "tagline": "Your Movies. Your Quality. Your Player. Gopac Player.",
    "shortDescription": "Every Movie. Every Moment. Exclusively Gopac Player.",
    "description": "# Gopac Player\n\nExperience your videos with Gopac Player, a premium offline Android video player designed for smooth playback, high-quality visuals, and a clean cinematic experience.\n\n### 🎬 Powerful Video Playback\nEnjoy your local video collection with support for popular media formats, including MP4, MKV, and high-efficiency HEVC (H.265) video, with broad audio codec compatibility through its media playback engine.\n\n### ⚡ Advanced Playback Controls\n- Double-tap to skip forward or backward by 10 seconds.\n- Hold to temporarily play at 2× speed.\n- Adjustable playback speed.\n- Smooth and precise timeline seeking.\n- Resume videos from where you left off.\n- Fullscreen landscape playback.\n\n### 🎧 Immersive Media Experience\n- Audio track selection.\n- Subtitle support and synchronization.\n- Multiple video and audio format support.\n- Hardware-accelerated decoding where supported.\n- Software decoding fallback where available.\n\n### 📂 Smart Video Library\n- Automatically discover videos stored on your device.\n- Cinematic featured video carousel.\n- Recently played and continue watching sections.\n- Smart video categories.\n- Favorites and organized browsing.\n- Video thumbnails, duration, and file information.\n\n### 🖤 Premium AMOLED Design\nEnjoy a distraction-free interface featuring a deep black theme, elegant red accents, modern layouts, and smooth animations.\n\n### 🔒 Offline & Private\nYour videos are played directly from your device. No account is required to browse your local video collection.\n\n**Gopac Player. Every Frame Matters.**\n\n*Playback performance and codec compatibility depend on your device hardware, Android version, and media format.*",
